sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Client as Client / Traffic Generator
    participant Gateway as Reverse Proxy Gateway (:3000)
    participant Upstream as Test API (:3001)
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka Broker
    participant Analytics as Stream Analytics Engine (:3002)
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL DB
    participant Redis as Redis Cache & Pub/Sub
    participant Dashboard as React SPA Dashboard (:5173)

    Client->>Gateway: HTTP GET /orders/123
    Gateway->>Gateway: Intercept request<br/>Generate request_id and record start_time
    Gateway->>Upstream: Forward proxy request
    Upstream-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 OK + payload
    Gateway-->>Client: Complete HTTP response immediately

    par Async Fire-and-Forget
        Gateway-->>Kafka: Produce TelemetryEvent<br/>topic: telemetry.raw
    end

    Kafka-->>Analytics: Consume TelemetryEvent<br/>analytics-group
    Analytics->>Analytics: Normalize route /orders/:id<br/>Buffer in 5s sliding window

    Analytics->>Analytics: Every 5 seconds — Rollup Window
    Analytics->>Postgres: Write batch rollups<br/>metrics_rollup and requests
    Analytics->>Redis: Cache hot state<br/>Publish live_metrics tick
    Analytics->>Analytics: Run anomaly detectors<br/>P95 > 150ms / errors > 5

    opt Anomaly Detected
        Analytics->>Postgres: Write anomaly record
        Analytics->>Kafka: Publish to anomalies.detected
    end

    Redis-->>Analytics: Subscribed live_metrics tick
    Analytics-->>Dashboard: WebSocket frame broadcast<br/>ws://localhost:3002
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: Update React state<br/>Render live charts